  "releaseNotes": "0.2.3: Blazor SuperAdminMenu and SuperAdminLayout write root-relative links (/admin/sync, path base kept) instead of absolute http:// links. Local UI:Stylesheets entries need no login, so the sign-in page loads them under Protection:Scope = All. 0.2.2 added the Blazor shell (SuperAdminLayout, SuperAdminHead, SuperAdminScripts), Bootstrap 5.3.8, --sa-* colour variables, UI:Stylesheets and UI:ColorMode; its SuperAdminMenu renders the sidebar markup by default (breaking: use Variant=\"SuperAdminMenuVariant.Plain\" for the old list). Full list: CHANGELOG.md in the repository.",
